# MTG Deck Builder — Commands & Flags

This project has a few main scripts:

- **`runlog.sh`** — entrypoint wrapper for watcher/suggester  
- **`draft_watch.py`** — live/replay watcher for Player.log  
- **`draft_suggester.py`** — watcher + heuristic pick suggester  
- **`view_parquet.py`** — viewer for `.parquet` / `.csv` outputs  

---

## Environment Variables

- `MTGA_PLAYER_LOG` — Path to your Arena `Player.log`  
  - macOS default: `~/Library/Logs/Wizards Of The Coast/MTGA/Player.log`  
- `GIHWR_INDEX_PATH` — Ratings CSV (`Name` + `GIHWR`)  
- `CARD_MAP_PATH` — Card ID → Name CSV (`mtga_card_id.csv`)  
- `DRAFT_OUT_DIR` — Output folder (defaults to `./draft_out`)  
- `DRAFT_DEBUG=1` — Debug logging (full fidelity; no truncation)  
- `DRAFT_MISC=1` — Also log misc non-table lines (init/scene/heartbeats). Default **off**.  
- `DRAFT_LIVE=1` — Live flush of CSV/Parquet after each event  

