## Viewer shortcuts (inspect parquet/CSV)

```bash
# Show Pack 1 Pick 1 options (best → worst by WR)
python3 view_parquet.py --p1p1

# Show a specific pack/pick (e.g., Pack 2 Pick 3)
python3 view_parquet.py --pack 2 --pick 3

# Show last 10 picks
python3 view_parquet.py --last-picks 10

# Export CSV next to parquet files
python3 view_parquet.py --export-csv

# Point viewer at suggester outputs instead of watcher
python3 view_parquet.py --suggest

# Live refresh without clearing the screen
python3 view_parquet.py --dir ./draft_out --watch --no-clear
```

