## Environment setup (ratings + id map)

```bash
# Ratings CSV (must include a GIH WR column; header variants are handled)
export GIHWR_INDEX_PATH="$(pwd)/log samples/eoe_card_ratings.csv"

# Optional: GRP id → Name map, improves numeric PackCards decoding
export CARD_MAP_PATH="$(pwd)/log samples/mtga_card_id.csv"
```

---

## Replay helpers

```bash
# Process only the last N lines and exit (no live tail)
./runlog.sh --replay --tail 40000 --input "$MTGA_PLAYER_LOG"

# Suggester replay (writes to draft_suggestions_out/)
./runlog.sh suggest --replay --tail 40000 --input "$MTGA_PLAYER_LOG"
```

