## Debugging / full log fidelity

```bash
# Turn on verbose logs (no truncation; extra heartbeats & sniffers)
export DRAFT_DEBUG=1

# Optional: add regex sniffing of pack/pick counters
export DRAFT_SNIFF=1

# Run watcher or suggester with debug on
./runlog.sh
./runlog.sh suggest
```

---

## Quick combined workflows

```bash
# 1) Start watcher (terminal A)
./runlog.sh

# 2) Live view parquet outputs (terminal B)
python3 view_parquet.py --dir ./draft_out --watch --no-clear

# 3) If using suggester:
./runlog.sh suggest                           # terminal A (alternate)
python3 view_parquet.py --suggest --watch     # terminal B
```

