## Grep cheats (safe bracket patterns)

```bash
# Suggestions only (suggester log)
grep -E '^\[[^]]+\].*suggested P' draft_suggestions_out/draft_watch.log

# Available pack lines (suggester or watcher log)
grep -E '^\[[^]]+\].*available P' draft_out/draft_watch.log
# or
grep -E '^\[[^]]+\].*available P' draft_suggestions_out/draft_watch.log
```